 when multiple focus sessions overlap.\n- Unlock codes can succeed at most 5 times per day; that limit is not adjustable.\n- Improved unlock dialog, usage, and open-count display.\n- Known: on some phones a blocked app may still flash briefly; Xiaomi issues still need real-device retest.\n- Android only. The iPhone version remains v0.1.5.\n\nversionCode: 33\nsha256: 250b9f6e6991fc71aecffebd7f2495b2479799e4141c12d6104f482330db4627\n","version": "0.1.14","versionCode": 33,"apkSizeBytes": 9256745,"sha256": "250b9f6e6991fc71aecffebd7f2495b2479799e4141c12d6104f482330db4627","ipaSizeBytes": 7764400,"ipaSha256": "3b7fca162f27b7033e45fe762f59587214bb7cb2c9cd1f4dcf047afb4f472f0f","iosVersion": "0.1.5","downloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.14.apk","iosDownloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa","mirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.14.apk","https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.14/ripple-v0.1.14.apk","https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.14/ripple-v0.1.14.apk","https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.14/ripple-v0.1.14.apk"],"iosMirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa","https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa","https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa","https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa"]}
